(86, NULL, 78, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 8, 'NIYINGENERA Thierry', 1, 'The Petroleum station was found non compliant', 'To remove kitchen and bar in petrol station compound\r\nTo install water based fire fighting system (water tank of 30\\text{ m}^3, water pump of 8bars, hose reels and fire hydrants)\r\nTo identify and mark assembly point, to mount evacuation\r\nTo team maintenance of CCTV Camera system (It should cover the entire compound, having control room and storage capacity of 2months)\r\nTo install fully functional fire alarm system (Smoke detectors, Control panel and manual call point) in all buildings\r\nTo mount emergency unit phone numbers (police, fire brigade and ambulance)\r\nTo provide and install fuel price board, illuminated entrance and exit signs visible in minimum 50 meters\r\nTo test paratlightning system to check whether it is still in good condition (every six months)\r\nTo provide enough fire extinguishers (2 pieces of 6kg DCP, 2 pieces of 9kg DCP, 2 pieces of 5kg \\text{CO}_2 and 2 pieces of 9kg foam)\r\nTo provide occupation permit, retail license via email (inspection@gasabo.gov.rw)', NULL, NULL, 48.50, 99.00, 48.99, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 09:46:19', '2026-08-12 13:27:08', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(87, NULL, 70, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'followup', 78, 2, 'completed', 14, 'ITANGISHAKA Fidele', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54.00, 100.00, 54.00, NULL, '2026-09-04 06:14:13', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 11:19:10', '2026-09-04 06:14:13', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(88, NULL, 79, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The premises have several fire safety and compliance deficiencies, including an inadequate water-based firefighting system, a faulty fire alarm control system, insufficient sand and shovels, inadequate fire extinguishers, incomplete CCTV coverage, and missing or incomplete required certificates and licences.', 'Install a functional water-based firefighting system with adequate pressure of at least 8 bar.\r\n1.Repair the fire alarm control system to ensure proper fire detection and alarm activation.\r\n2.Provide sand in all designated sand buckets and ensure each is equipped with a shovel.\r\n3.Provide two additional 9 kg fire extinguishers as required.\r\n4.Install a CCTV system covering the entire premises and maintain at least 3 months of recording storage.\r\n5.Obtain and provide all required valid documents, including the insurance certificate, retail licence, fuel tank calibration certificate, dispenser certificate, electrical installation certificate, and relevant inspection certificate.', NULL, NULL, 54.00, 100.00, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 13:28:34', '2026-08-12 13:28:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(89, NULL, 80, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The premises require improvement in overall emergency preparedness and safety compliance, particularly in firefighting infrastructure, fire alarm functionality, emergency communication and evacuation arrangements, electrical safety certification, required documentation, and the adequacy of fire extinguishers.', '1.Install a functional water-based firefighting system with a pump, 30 m³ water tank, hydrants, and hose reels covering the entire premises.\r\n2.Repair the fire alarm control system and ensure it is fully functional.\r\n3.Display emergency contact numbers, assembly point signs, and emergency evacuation plans in appropriate locations.\r\n4.Service the electrical installation and obtain a valid Electrical Installation Certificate.\r\n5.Provide valid required documents, including the insurance certificate, retail licence, fuel tank calibration certificate, dispenser certificate, and inspection certificate.\r\n6.Provide additional fire extinguishers, including one 9 kg foam extinguisher and one 9 kg powder extinguisher, as required.', NULL, NULL, 52.50, 100.00, 52.50, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 13:41:48', '2026-08-12 13:41:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(90, NULL, 81, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The premises have gaps in fire protection, emergency preparedness, and regulatory compliance, particularly regarding adequate fire extinguishers, a functional fire alarm system, emergency shut-off facilities, required safety documentation, and accessible emergency contact information.', 'Provide additional fire extinguishers, including one 9 kg foam extinguisher and one 9 kg powder extinguisher, and replace all expired extinguishers.\r\nRepair the fire alarm control system and ensure it is fully operational.\r\nObtain and provide valid electrical installation, retail, fuel tank calibration, and relevant inspection certificates.\r\nInstall a clearly accessible emergency stop switch.\r\nDisplay emergency contact numbers in visible and accessible locations around the premises.', NULL, NULL, 79.00, 100.00, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 13:46:07', '2026-08-12 13:52:23', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(91, NULL, 82, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'The petrol station does not meet the required fire safety and security system standards.', '1. Install a fire pump  \r\n   Provide a fire pump with a minimum pressure of 8 bar.\r\n\r\n2. Provide water storage for firefighting \r\n   Install a water storage tank of 30 m³ dedicated for firefighting purposes.\r\n\r\n3. Remove unauthorized structures  \r\n   Remove the shed located around the power house (electrical room).\r\n\r\n4. Display emergency information \r\n   Provide an evacuation plan and emergency response phone numbers at all visible locations.\r\n\r\n5. Provide first aid facilities  \r\n   Provide a first aid box equipped with all essential elements.\r\n\r\n6. Install illuminated signage \r\n   Install illuminated entrance and exit signs.\r\n\r\n7. Provide additional fire extinguishers  \r\n   Provide an additional 25kg DCP fire extinguisher.\r\n\r\n8. Manage car parking\r\n   Car parking space behind the station should not be provided as more than 5 spaces.\r\n\r\n9. Submit required documents  \r\n   Avail the following documents:  \r\n   a) Valid Insurance  \r\n   b) Retail License  \r\n   c) Occupancy Permit\r\n\r\n11. Provide changing facilities  \r\n    Provide changing rooms for both male and female staff, properly labeled.', NULL, NULL, 57.00, 100.00, 57.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 16:15:43', '2026-08-13 05:58:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(92, NULL, 83, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To Provide  additional one (1) 9 kg Foam Fire Extinguisher, one (1) 9 kg CO₂ Fire Extinguisher, and one (1) 25 kg Dry Chemical Powder (DCP) Fire Extinguisher.\r\nb. To install  at least an additional 5,000-litre water tank to achieve the minimum required firefighting water storage capacity of 30 m³.\r\nc. To maintain  fire alarm system, including the control panel, in good working condition. \r\nd. To increase  CCTV cameras  storage capacity to achieve a minimum video storage capacity of 90 days.\r\ne. To install clearly visible entrance and exit signs made of illuminated retro-reflective materials and ensure that they are readable from a minimum distance of 50 meters.\r\nf. To provide a toilet facility accessible to persons with disabilities.\r\ng. To Stop discharging wastewater into the public drainage system and establish an appropriate wastewater management system in accordance with applicable regulations.\r\nh. To hire permanent trained security staff from a registered security company to ensure continuous security coverage of the facility.\r\ni. To Submit valid copies of the following documents to the City of Kigali via info@kigalicity.gov.rw: Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate; and Retail License within two weeks.', NULL, NULL, 69.50, 100.00, 69.50, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 07:39:49', '2026-08-13 16:21:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(93, NULL, 84, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To connect the water-based firefighting system to a dedicated water pump capable of maintaining a pressure between 8 and 15 bar.\r\nb. To increase the water storage tank capacity to a minimum of 30 m³.\r\nc. To establish a CCTV control room  at petrol station and ensure storage capacity of at least 90 days.\r\nd. To Provide and maintain a fully equipped first-aid kit at the facility.\r\ne. To maintain the standby generator in good working condition and ensure it operates automatically during power outages.\r\nf. To conduct periodic testing of the lightning protection system at least once every six (6) months and keep valid test records available for inspection.\r\ng. To Submit the following valid documents to the City of Kigali via info@kigalicity.gov.rw: Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate; Construction Permit; Occupation Permit; Fuel Tank Calibration Certificate; Dispenser Test Certificate; Retail License; and Valid Insurance Certificate within two weeks.', NULL, NULL, 62.00, 100.00, 62.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 08:37:13', '2026-08-13 16:17:11', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
