(101, NULL, 92, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-18', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To provide  additional one (1) 9 kg Foam Fire Extinguisher, one (1) 9 kg CO₂ Fire Extinguisher, and two (2) 25 kg Dry Chemical Powder (DCP) Fire Extinguishers.\r\nb. To replace the existing water pump with a firefighting water pump capable of maintaining a pressure between 8 and 15 bar. \r\nc. To repair or replace the damaged fire hose reel.\r\nd. To provide dry fine sand  with at least two shovels.\r\ne. To maintain the fire alarm system and CCTV cameras in good working condition, and ensure that CCTV footage is retained for a minimum period of 90 days.\r\nf. To display an emergency evacuation plan, and clearly mark the emergency assembly point.\r\ng. To install clearly visible entrance and exit signs made of illuminated retro-reflective materials and ensure that they are readable from a minimum distance of 50 meters.\r\nh. To provide and maintain a fully equipped first-aid kit. \r\ni. To hire trained security staff from a registered security company.\r\nj. To conduct periodic testing of the lightning protection system at least once every six (6) months and maintain valid test records for inspection.\r\nk. To submit copies of the following valid documents to the City of Kigali via info@kigalicity.gov.rw: Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate; construction permit, Occupation Permit; Fuel Tank Calibration Certificate; Dispenser Test Certificate; Retail License; and Valid Insurance within two weeks.', NULL, NULL, 63.50, 100.00, 63.50, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-18 12:56:23', '2026-08-18 13:46:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
