(104, NULL, 95, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'Petrol station not complying with fire safety and security', '1. Install water-based firefighting system  \r\n   Install hose reel, fire hydrant, water tank with 30m³ capacity, and fire pump with minimum 8 bar pressure. Ensure the system is fully functional.\r\n2. Provide additional fire extinguishers  \r\n   Provide 9kg CO₂ and 9kg Foam type fire extinguishers.\r\n3. Restore fire alarm system\r\n   Repair and restore the fire alarm system and ensure it is fully functional.\r\n4. Test lightning protection system  \r\n   Test the lightning protection system every 6 months and obtain test results.\r\n5. Clear generator area  \r\n   Remove all materials stored around the generator room.\r\n6. Upgrade CCTV storage  \r\n   Upgrade CCTV camera storage to retain footage for at least 3 months / 90 days.\r\n7. Conduct electrical audit  \r\n   Conduct electrical installation audit every 3 years and obtain compliance certificate.\r\n8. Install assembly points and exit signs  \r\n   Install assembly points and emergency exit signs.\r\n9. Provide First Aid box\r\n   Provide a First Aid box with all required elements.\r\n10. Avail mandatory documents  \r\n    Avail the following documents: Occupation Permit, Retail License, and EIA Certificate. Submit them via e-mail:info@kigalicity.gov;rw\r\n11. Install emergency stop pushbutton\r\n12. Provide additional pedal dustbins  \r\n    Provide additional pedal dustbins and improve hygiene in the compound.', NULL, NULL, 63.00, 100.00, 63.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19 12:06:54', '2026-08-19 16:08:52', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
