(106, NULL, 97, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To maintain the water-based firefighting system, including hose reels and fire hydrants, and install a water pump capable of maintaining a pressure between 8 and 15 bar. \r\nb. To increase the firefighting water  tank storage capacity to at least 30 m³.\r\nc. To provide  additional one (1) 9 kg Foam Fire Extinguisher and one (1) 9 kg CO₂ Fire Extinguisher.\r\nd. To display emergency hotline numbers (contacts for the Police, Fire Brigade, and Ambulance).\r\ne. To display emergency evacuation plan.\r\nf. To install clearly visible entrance and exit signs made of illuminated retro-reflective materials and ensure they are readable from a minimum distance of 50 meters.\r\ng. To increase the CCTV system storage capacity to retain surveillance footage for at least 90 days.\r\nh. To Conduct periodic testing of the lightning protection system at least once every six (6) months and keep valid test records.\r\ni. To provide and maintain at least three toilet facilities, comprising separate toilets for males, females, and persons with disabilities, as well as two changing rooms.\r\nj. To send copies of the following valid documents to the City of Kigali via info@kigalicity.gov.rw: Occupation Permit; Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate; Fuel Tank Calibration Certificate; Dispenser Test Certificate; Retail License; and Valid Insurance Certificate within two weeks.', NULL, NULL, 52.00, 100.00, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19 13:42:00', '2026-08-20 10:15:13', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(107, '435/07.01.14/26', 98, 7, 'construction', 'superstructure', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 14, 'ITANGISHAKA Fidele', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 41.00, 100.00, 41.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19 14:26:57', '2026-08-24 09:05:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(108, NULL, 99, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To provide and maintain an additional one (1) 9 kg Foam Fire Extinguisher, one (1) 9 kg CO₂ Fire Extinguisher, and two (2) 25 kg Dry Chemical Powder (DCP) Fire Extinguishers.\r\nb. To install a firefighting water pump capable of maintaining a pressure between 8 and 15 bar and increase the firefighting water storage tank capacity to at least 30 m³.\r\nc. To provide  dry fine sand  with at least two shovels.\r\nd. To display an emergency evacuation plan and clearly identify the emergency assembly point.\r\ne. To increase the number of CCTV cameras to ensure full coverage of the premises and expand the storage capacity to retain surveillance footage for a minimum of 90 days.\r\nf. To conduct periodic testing of the lightning protection system at least once every six (6) months and maintain valid test records for inspection.\r\ng. To Send copies of the following valid documents to the City of Kigali via info@kigalicity.gov.rw within two weeks: Occupation Permit; Construction Permit; Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate; Fuel Tank Calibration Certificate; Dispenser Test Certificate; Retail License; and Valid Insurance.', NULL, NULL, 59.00, 100.00, 59.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19 15:24:52', '2026-08-20 11:29:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
