(154, NULL, 148, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 8, 'NIYINGENERA Thierry', 1, NULL, '1.	Install a fully functional fire alarm system including smoke detectors, control panel, and manual call points.\r\n2.	Install a complete water-based firefighting system including water tank, pumps, hydrants, and hose reels.\r\n3.	Provide adequate fire extinguishers (at least 9kg DCP type) at required strategic locations.\r\n4.	Install CCTV cameras and establish a control room with at least 3 months data storage capacity.\r\n5.	Install a proper lightning protection system to protect the building from lightning strikes.\r\n6.	Obtain and provide an electrical installation compliance certificate after inspection and approval.\r\n7.	Install clear emergency exit signage, assembly point signage, and develop an evacuation plan.', NULL, NULL, 11.00, 61.00, 18.03, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 05:17:15', '2026-09-02 05:26:32', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
