(156, NULL, 150, NULL, 'waste_water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 23, 'MUNYANEZA Honeste', 3, '1. STP structurally sound.\r\n2. Previous issues (Digging a pit to trap swimming pool bathing water) has been corrected, but the pit need a ventilation pipe \r\n3. STP effluent samples for test has been collected as previously recommened, payment receipts on 18/08/2026 was observed and checked.', '1. Installing a ventilation pipe on a side separate soak away pit trapping specifically swimming pool washing rooms.\r\n2. Conducting STP effluent quality test results every six months', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 08:31:44', '2026-09-02 08:31:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(157, NULL, 151, 15, 'waste_water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 3, 'Physical appearance (turbidity) of treated waste water is High and bad adour for final effluent.', '1. To Upgrade Sewage Treatment Plant \r\n2. To Avail logbook for maintenance records \r\n3. Deep Clean the chamber of Screening and overall maintenance to all chambers\r\n4.Make settling tank functions properly,', NULL, NULL, 13.00, 17.00, 76.47, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 09:18:10', '2026-09-08 05:41:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, 300.00, 6000, 125.00, 2006, '2026-08-13', NULL, 'annually', 'partially_functional', NULL, '2026-06-10', 'UR', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(158, NULL, 152, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-27', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'Generally, the premises require improvements in fire safety, security, electrical compliance, ventilation, and emergency protection systems to ensure a safe and compliant environment.', '1.Install an appropriate automatic fire suppression system such as DSPA aerosol or FM-200.\r\n2.Install a 30 m³ firefighting water reservoir/tank.\r\n3.Install and maintain a functional fire alarm system with a control panel.\r\n4.Install a functional beam detection system where required.\r\n5.Install a functional heat detection system where required.\r\n6.Provide adequate CCTV cameras, a control room, and 3-month video storage.\r\n7.Provide adequate security screening equipment, including luggage scanners, metal detectors, and under-search mirrors.\r\n8.Conduct an electrical safety inspection and obtain a valid compliance certificate.\r\n9.Install and test the lightning protection system every six months.\r\n10.Provide UPS systems for critical equipment where required.\r\n11.Ensure elevator inspection every six months with proper records.\r\n12.Provide adequate mechanical ventilation where required.\r\n13.Completely separate the gas kitchen from charcoal/wood cooking areas.\r\n14.Install a functional gas detector and automatic shut-off valve.\r\n15.Improve ventilation and air circulation to maintain safe indoor air quality.', NULL, NULL, 58.00, 94.00, 61.70, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 10:33:00', '2026-09-02 10:33:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(159, NULL, 153, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-01', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'petrol station do not comply with fire safety and security regulations', 'To Install a water tank with 30m³ capacity and a fire pump with a minimum pressure of 8 bar. \r\nTo Repair the fire alarm system and install a control panel.\r\nTo Test the lightning protection system every 6 months by a licensed engineer.\r\nTo Improve hygiene around the generator room.\r\nTo Upgrade CCTV camera storage to 3 months.\r\nTo Avail the following documents and send them via email to info@kigalicity.gov.rw:Occupation Permit,Valid Insurance ,Retail License\r\nTo Provide additional fire extinguishers: 25kg DCP (1)9kg CO₂ (1)9kg Foam (1)\r\nAnd refill all expired extinguishers.\r\nTo Repair the fire hydrant.\r\nTo Equip the sand box with a shovel.\r\nTo Install illuminated entrance and exit signs.\r\nTo Conduct general cleaning and remove all waste scattered behind the station.\r\nTo Provide separate changing rooms for staff: one for Males and one for Females.\r\nTo Restock the First Aid box with all essential items and train staff on its use.\r\nTo Remove clothes and shoes stored on top of the generator.\r\nTo Label washrooms for Male, Female, and Persons with Disabilities.\r\nTo Repair the damaged pavement in front of the petrol station.\r\nTo Provide handwashing facilities.', NULL, NULL, 53.00, 100.00, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 10:44:30', '2026-09-02 10:44:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(160, NULL, 154, 15, 'waste_water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 3, '1.STP is not functioning bcz it is under maintenance;\r\n2.Now, they practice rugular emptying, emptying frequency once in 2 or 3 days;\r\n3.Perment bad smell', '1.Quick upgrade of STP by adding well maintained settling tanks, filtration stage and automated chlorination stage for treatment efficiency \r\n\r\n2.Continuing regular emptying until the STP upgrade finished;\r\n3.Conduct effluent laboratory test by accredited laboratory', NULL, NULL, 12.00, 17.00, 70.59, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 10:46:12', '2026-09-08 11:03:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, 50.00, 200, NULL, 2006, '2026-09-02', '2026-07-01', '6_monthly', 'partially_functional', NULL, '2026-07-14', 'UR', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(161, NULL, 155, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'Generally, the premises have gaps in safety, emergency preparedness, accessibility, and security arrangements that require attention.', '1.Clearly mark emergency exit routes and signs.\r\n2.Display emergency evacuation and floor plans.\r\n3.Clearly display floor/level number signs.\r\n4.Display emergency contact numbers.\r\n5.Provide designated assembly areas and signs.\r\n6.Provide dustbins with shovels.\r\n7.Provide adequate PWD facilities, signs, and accessible pathways.\r\n8.Provide CCTV cameras, a control room, and 3-month video storage.\r\n9.Ensure unobstructed access for fire and rescue services.\r\n10.Provide updated electrical diagrams for the elevator.', NULL, NULL, 40.00, 69.00, 57.97, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 11:05:16', '2026-09-02 11:05:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
