(163, NULL, 157, NULL, 'waste_water', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 2, '1. disinfection is not  done properly \r\n2.the stp system need general cleaning (sludge emptying)\r\n3. Oil and grease trap chamber is full\r\n4. Solide particles were observed in last chamber \r\n5. Discharge of untreated wastewater into environment \r\n6. Effluent test results are available which have been conducted by UR on June 2026 but apparently desinfection is not well functioning and we have observed solid particles in last chamber', '1. To stop immediately discharging untreated wastewater into environment and work with wastewater emptying company until you do appropriate maintenance of stp and wasac wastewater laboratory results \r\n2. To install appropriate desinfection chambers for both stp  by making sure that desinfection is done properly \r\n3. To do general cleaning of both stp\r\n4.emptying screening chambers and oil and grease trap', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-02 11:28:41', '2026-09-02 11:28:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
