(202, NULL, 196, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-09', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To install a functional fire alarm system equipped with a control panel.\r\nb. To ensure that the hose reel system is fully operational by maintaining a continuous water supply at all times.\r\nc. To ensure that the fire hydrant system is fully operational by maintaining a continuous water supply at all times.\r\nd. To designate suitable emergency assembly areas and provide clearly visible assembly point signs.\r\ne. To install a suitable firefighting water pump capable of providing the required pressure of 8–15 bar.\r\nf. To provide adequately equipped first aid boxes at accessible and clearly identified locations.\r\ng. To provide a suitable standby generator to ensure continuity of essential electrical services during power outages.', NULL, NULL, 35.00, 53.00, 66.04, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 08:51:24', '2026-09-07 08:51:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(204, NULL, 198, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-09', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'not complying with fire safety and security regulations', '1.	Revise the electrical installation and obtain a valid Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate. \r\n2.	Install a water-based firefighting system. \r\n3.	Install an automatic sprinkler system and DSPA automatic fire suppression system in the production area. \r\n4.	Provide 2 × 12 kg CO₂ and 2 × 25 kg DCP fire extinguishers. \r\n5.	Provide insurance coverage and appropriate PPE for all employees. \r\n6.	Improve general cleanliness throughout the premises.', NULL, NULL, 6.00, 57.00, 10.53, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 09:06:17', '2026-09-07 09:06:17', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(205, NULL, 199, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 2, '- At the grease trap, not all grease is effectively retained; some grease escapes and proceeds to subsequent treatment stages without proper removal.\r\n- There\'s unpleasant odour. \r\n- No effluent lab tests results from recognized laboratory.', '- To upgrade the grease strap system for proper operation \r\n- Conduct regular effluent sampling and laboratory analysis(lab tests results)\r\n- Immediately stop reusing water from STP until you get effluent lab tests results that comply with national standards.', NULL, NULL, 9.00, 16.00, 56.25, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 09:12:19', '2026-09-07 09:17:02', NULL, 2024, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-20', NULL, NULL, NULL, '- At the grease trap, not all grease is effectively retained; some grease escapes and proceeds to subsequent treatment stages without proper removal.\r\n- There\'s unpleasant odour. \r\n- No effluent lab tests results from recognized laboratory.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(206, NULL, 200, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 16, 'RUKUNDO Augustin', 3, '1. The inspection established that the Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) was not operational due to a lack of electricity. \r\n2. The chlorine dosing system and filtration unit were poorly installed, potentially compromising the treatment and disinfection processes. \r\n3. In addition, the facility does not have a licensed maintenance company or a qualified operator responsible for the operation and routine maintenance of the STP.', '1. Restore a reliable electricity supply and ensure continuous operation of the STP.\r\n2. Correctly and properly install the chlorine dosing system and filtration unit.\r\n3. Engage a licensed wastewater/STP maintenance company to operate and maintain the system.\r\n4. Employ or assign a qualified and competent STP operator for daily operation and monitoring.\r\n5. Conduct effluent quality testing once the STP is operational to confirm compliance with applicable standards.', NULL, NULL, 7.00, 15.00, 46.67, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 09:50:51', '2026-09-07 18:32:18', 'Yes', 2011, 'HAKIZIMANA Marceline', '0788291906', 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, 22.00, 200, NULL, 2022, '2026-08-22', '2026-08-22', 'as_needed', 'partially_functional', NULL, '2024-12-05', 'UR', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(207, NULL, 201, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-09', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'entity does not comply with fire safety and security regulations', '1.	Revise the electrical installation and obtain a valid Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate. \r\n2.	Install a water-based firefighting system. \r\n3.	Install a fire alarm system with a control panel. \r\n4.	Refill expired fire extinguishers and mount them in accessible locations. \r\n5.	Provide a designated motorcycle oil service area. \r\n6.	Properly organize scattered materials in the store.', NULL, NULL, 8.00, 59.00, 13.56, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 09:57:28', '2026-09-07 10:02:11', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
