(213, NULL, 207, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-24', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 21, 'IGIHOZO Honorine', 3, NULL, '-To install DCP fire extinguishers in parallel with CO2 fire extinguishers and replace the existing 2kg CO2 fire extinguishers with 9 kg fire extinguisher.\r\n-To maintain fire hydrant which is not working.\r\n-To avail dust vase with shovels in the car parking.\r\n- To increase number of CCTV cameras in order to cover all area and increase their storage capacity in order to keep footage at least 3 months (90 days)\r\n- To avail first aid boxes.\r\n-To perform testing of para-lighting periodically (every 6 months ) and avail testing record.', NULL, NULL, 69.00, 77.00, 89.61, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 11:46:14', '2026-09-07 11:46:14', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(214, NULL, 208, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-09', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To apply for  occupation permit.\r\nb. To avail  valid building insurance.\r\nc. To conduct an inspection and testing of the electrical installation and obtain a valid electrical installation compliance certificate.\r\nd. To appoint  trained security staff from registered security company.\r\ne. To provide fire blankets at  in kitchen areas.\r\nf. To ensure that the hose reel system is fully operational by maintaining a continuous water supply at all times.\r\ng. To ensure that the fire hydrant system is fully operational by maintaining a continuous water supply at all times.\r\nh. To install a complete and functional fire alarm system equipped with a control panel.\r\ni. To install clearly visible emergency exit signs along all designated evacuation routes.\r\nj. To display emergency evacuation plan for the building.\r\nk. To install clearly visible floor/level number signs on each level.\r\nl. To display emergency response units’ telephone numbers, including those of the Police, Fire and Rescue brigade, and Ambulance Services, at visible and accessible locations.\r\nm. To designate suitable emergency assembly areas and provide clearly visible assembly point signs.\r\nn. To provide  equipped first aid boxes at accessible and clearly identified locations.\r\no. To complete the installation of the standby generator to ensure a reliable backup power supply during power outages.', NULL, NULL, 25.00, 70.00, 35.71, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07 13:05:19', '2026-09-07 13:05:19', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(215, NULL, 209, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-04', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 8, 'NIYINGENERA Thierry', 1, NULL, 'To do maintenance of fire alarm system.\r\nRefill expired fire extinguishers, and provide additional (CO2 and foam).\r\nTo avail and install backup generator.\r\nTo provide proper signages (no smoking, switch off engine, assembly point, evacuation plan).\r\nTo conduct audit of electrical installation and obtain electrical installation compliance certificate\r\nTo provide retail licence, calibration certificate, occupation permit and certificate of electrical installation compliance certificate via email.', NULL, NULL, 65.50, 99.00, 66.16, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 05:20:05', '2026-09-08 05:20:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(216, NULL, 210, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-07', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 2, '- The STP is currently non-functional; wastewater is emptied twice per week.\r\n- Wastewater generated from the laundry is discharged directly into the soil through a soak pit and into the public drainage system.\r\n- All pits are filled with sludge.\r\n- Access to the STP is restricted due to construction materials stored within the facility area.', '- Empty all pits and upgrade the STP system to ensure effective wastewater treatment.\r\n- Repair and restore the STP pumps and machines to full operational condition and ensure regular maintenance and monitoring.\r\n- Provide lab tests results of treated wastes water before discharge.\r\n- Stop the direct discharge of untreated laundry wastewater into the soil and public drainage system.\r\n- To establish a regular emptying schedule and  keep the record to prevent overflow and environmental contamination.\r\n- Remove and relocate construction materials to ensure safe and unrestricted access to the STP.', NULL, NULL, 2.00, 17.00, 11.76, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 05:26:59', '2026-09-08 05:33:55', 'V.K/KIC/KICUKIR/118/005', 2013, 'Paul HAKIZA', '0788352049', 'stp', NULL, 'activated_sludge', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'monthly', 'non_functional', '- The STP is currently non-functional; wastewater is emptied twice per week.\r\n- Wastewater generated from the laundry is discharged directly into the soil through a soak pit and into the public drainage system.\r\n- All pits are filled with sludge.\r\n- Access to the STP is restricted due to construction materials stored within the facility area.', NULL, NULL, 'other', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(217, NULL, 211, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The inspection of UMWARIMU SACCO HQ (Kimironko, Gasabo District), conducted on 04/08/2026, found overall The main gaps identified relate to firefighting water supply infrastructure, electrical safety certification, and minor safety provisions, as detailed below.', '1.Install a 30 m³ water reservoir/tank to ensure an adequate water supply for firefighting.\r\n2.Install a fire water pump capable of operating at 8–15 bar to ensure adequate firefighting water pressure.\r\n3.Provide dustbins with shovels at designated areas.\r\n4.Conduct an electrical safety inspection and obtain a valid electrical installation compliance certificate in accordance with applicable standards.\r\n5.Install and regularly test the lightning protection system, with testing conducted at least every six months.', NULL, NULL, 47.00, 63.00, 74.60, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 05:34:03', '2026-09-08 05:34:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(218, NULL, 212, 2, 'petrol', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-04', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 8, 'NIYINGENERA Thierry', 1, NULL, 'To install water based firefighting system (water tank of 50\\text{ m}^3, pump of 8 bar, hose reel and fire hydrants) that cover the whole premise.\r\nTo install CCTV cameras and control room with storage of 3 months.\r\nTo provide additional fire extinguishers (1 piece of 25kg DCP, 9kg CO2, and 9kg foam).\r\nTo mount visible sign post for emergency hot line, entrance and exit signs using retro-reflective material clearly readable.\r\nTo refill expired fire extinguishers.\r\nTo provide dust bin (sand boxes) with shovels in the car parking.\r\nTo conduct audit of electrical installation and obtain electrical installation compliance certificate.\r\nTo provide calibration certificate via email', NULL, NULL, 75.50, 99.00, 76.26, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 05:37:57', '2026-09-08 05:37:57', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(219, NULL, 213, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 8, 'NIYINGENERA Thierry', 1, NULL, '1.	Install a complete water-based firefighting system, including a 30 m³ water tank, fire hose reels, fire hydrants, and fire pumps capable of maintaining at least 8bars of pressure.\r\n2.	Provide and install emergency exit signs, assembly point signs, emergency contact numbers, \"Do Not Use the Elevator in Case of Fire\" signs, and evacuation plans throughout the facility.\r\n3.	Provide adequate sand boxes and shovels in the car parking area to improve housekeeping.\r\n4.	Increase the CCTV recording storage capacity to retain surveillance footage for at least three (3) months.\r\n5.	Relocate LPG cylinders outside the kitchen, install a gas leak detector with an automatic shut-off valve, and provide a fire blanket and a wet chemical fire extinguisher.\r\n6.	Install a fire alarm system comprising smoke detectors, a fire alarm control panel, and manual call points.\r\n7.	Upgrade the electrical installation, improve network cable management, and obtain an Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate after completion of the work.\r\n8.	Perform comprehensive maintenance on the elevator to eliminate vibration, restore the floor indicator display, and correct all identified faults.\r\n9.	Test the lightning protection system to verify its effectiveness and ensure the earth resistance is less than 5 ohms.', NULL, NULL, 28.00, 72.00, 38.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 07:02:54', '2026-09-08 07:02:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(220, NULL, 214, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 23, 'MUNYANEZA Honeste', 3, '1. Blowers and screening have been set and are working\r\n2. No chlorination was observed\r\n3. No test results', '1. Set effective chlorination.\r\n2. Improve grease trap\r\n3. Restore the STP and conduct effluent quality test results for affirmation of further discharge.\r\n4. Avoid any discharge in the public channel and wait until the restoration of the STP gives valid test results.', NULL, NULL, 11.00, 16.00, 68.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 08:08:44', '2026-09-08 08:08:44', 'KCPS-OP-AAA002040', 2015, 'KARINGANIRE Umutoni Nouriat', '0788264314', 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, 486.00, 2000, 300.00, 2013, '2026-09-08', '2026-09-07', 'as_needed', 'partially_functional', 'The restored other parts of the STP, but chlorination is still missing.', NULL, 'None', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(221, NULL, 215, 16, 'waste_water', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 2, '- There\'s no STP available,they use septic tank.\r\n- Their septic tanks covers are not accessible.\r\n- They directly discharged sewage into public drainage \r\n- Unpleasant smell in the public due to direct discharge sewage in public drainage.\r\n- Their septic tanks are constructed under Alvin space bar.\r\n- Borehole system available with authorization \r\n Kitchen inspection: \r\n- Poor storage of food \r\n- There\'s lizard seen in the kitchen utensils \r\n- No medical certificate of staff \r\n- No changing room for staff \r\n- No heat extractor \r\n- No water heater for utensils cleaning \r\n- No calibration of refrigerators \r\n- No gas detectors in the kitchen.\r\n- Poor hygiene & poor housekeeping in the kitchen', '- Install functioning STP.\r\n- Ensure septic tank covers/manholes are accessible for inspection and desludging.\r\n- Relocate/modify the septic tanks currently located under Alvin Space Bar to ensure safe access and maintenance or relocate kitchen activities \r\n- Maintain valid borehole authorization\r\nSchool Kitchen Hygiene and Safety\r\n\r\n- Improve food storage conditions and maintain proper segregation.\r\n- Ensure all food handlers have valid medical certificates.\r\n- Provide a staff changing room.\r\n- Install a heat extractor/ventilation system in the kitchen.\r\n- Provide a water heater for cleaning utensils.\r\n- Calibrate refrigerators and maintain calibration records.\r\n- Install appropriate gas detectors in the kitchen.\r\n- Improve kitchen hygiene and housekeeping through regular cleaning and proper organization.', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 14.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 08:11:36', '2026-09-08 08:25:44', NULL, NULL, 'Rugamba Henry', '0780082333', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'two_chamber', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'under_building', 'poor', 'direct_discharge', NULL, 'unable_to_determine', '- There\'s no STP available,they use septic tank.\r\n- Their septic tanks covers are not accessible.\r\n- They directly discharged sewage into public drainage \r\n- Their septic tanks are constructed under Alvin space bar.\r\n- Borehole system available with authorization \r\n Kitchen inspection: \r\n- Poor storage of food \r\n- No medical certificate of staff \r\n- No changing room for staff \r\n- No heat extractor \r\n- No water heater for utensils cleaning \r\n- No calibration of refrigerators \r\n- No gas detectors in the kitchen.\r\n- Poor hygiene & poor housekeeping in the kitchen', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
