(225, NULL, 170, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08', 'new', NULL, 2, 'completed', 23, 'MUNYANEZA Honeste', 3, '1. All chambers of the STP do not function (No aeration, sedimentation and desinfection)\r\n2. No grease trap while they have two kitchens.\r\n3. No test results.\r\n4. The STP effluent is directed and discharged to the public drainage channel.\r\n5. Emptying is done for sludges only, water goes to public channel.', '1. Immediately stop discharging untreated wastewater from the STP to the public drainage and seal the outlet discharging pipe.\r\n2. Restore the whole STP and set all STP chambers into functioning state (grease traping, aeration, sedimentation and chlorination)\r\n3. Then after conduct STP effluent quality test after STP restoration for affirmation of further discharge into the public drainage channel and submit them to the City of Kigali.', NULL, NULL, 6.00, 15.00, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-08 12:38:09', '2026-09-08 12:38:09', 'Pending', 2026, 'Cpt(rtd) Gilbert Haston', '0788381960', 'stp', NULL, 'activated_sludge', NULL, NULL, 40, NULL, 2020, '2023-05-16', '2026-02-23', 'as_needed', 'non_functional', 'STP is not functional', NULL, 'None', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
