(247, NULL, 236, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-09', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'the gaps that do exist cluster in fire safety signage/wayfinding and electrical certification/testing routines rather than missing hardware, indicating the underlying safety equipment is mostly in place and the priority now is closing documentation, certification, and testing-cadence gaps (electrical compliance certificate, lightning protection testing, generator suppression, and clearer emergency signage and access).', '1.	Provide and properly distribute DCP, CO₂, and foam fire extinguishers at intervals not exceeding 15 m on each floor. \r\n2.	Clearly mark and maintain accessible emergency exit routes with illuminated exit signs throughout the premises. \r\n3.	Provide and clearly display emergency evacuation and floor plans in visible locations. \r\n4.	Clearly display emergency contact numbers for police, fire brigade, and ambulance. \r\n5.	Provide designated assembly areas with clearly visible signage. \r\n6.	Ensure clear, unobstructed access for fire and rescue services at all times.', NULL, NULL, 22.00, 46.00, 47.83, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 10:45:10', '2026-09-10 10:54:39', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(248, NULL, 237, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'Entity does not comply with fire safety and safety regulations', 'Here’s the rewritten version of your *GENERAL OBSERVATIONS & RECOMMENDATIONS* from the City of Kigali inspection form:\r\n\r\n*GENERAL OBSERVATIONS*\r\nThe entity does not fully comply with fire safety and security regulations. It is only partially complying.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*GENERAL RECOMMENDATIONS*\r\n\r\nFire Fighting Systems\r\n1. To Repair the water-based firefighting system, including:\r\n   - Fire hydrant with 70mm or 45mm outlets\r\n   - Fire hose reel - 30m\r\n   - Water storage tank - 30m³ \r\n   - Fire pump with 8 bar pressure\r\n\r\nAlarm & Monitoring\r\n2. To Install a fire alarm system with a central control panel covering the entire premises.\r\n\r\nElectrical & Lightning Safety\r\n3. To Review the electrical installation every 3 years and obtain a compliance certificate.\r\n4. To Test the lightning protection system every 6 months by a competent engineer.\r\n\r\nDocumentation\r\n5. To Submit the Occupation Permit and Building Insurance to: `info@kigalicity.gov.rw`\r\n\r\nEmergency Preparedness & Safety\r\n6. To Provide an evacuation plan.\r\n7. To Provide an under-vehicle mirror.\r\n8. To Provide an assembly point. _Note: One is currently available in the parking area._\r\n9. To Provide a first aid box.\r\n10. To Provide additional fire extinguishers: 1 x 9kg DCP and 1 x 9kg CO₂ in the Market Management Building office block.\r\n11. To Remove all stored materials from the generator house.\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: All recommendations should be implemented within 30 days from today.', NULL, NULL, 29.00, 68.00, 42.65, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 10:48:40', '2026-09-10 10:48:52', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(249, NULL, 238, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'Partial complying', 'Fire Detection & Alarm\r\n1. To Install a fire alarm system with a central control panel.\r\n\r\nFire Extinguishers\r\n2.to  Mount fire extinguishers every 15m throughout the entire premises: 9kg DCP and 9kg CO₂ for each type.\r\n3. To Mount a 9kg CO₂ fire extinguisher in the generator house.\r\n\r\n4. To Upgrade CCTV camera storage capacity to 3 months.\r\n5. To Increase CCTV camera coverage to cover the entire premises.\r\n\r\nDocumentation\r\n6. To Submit the Occupation Permit.\r\n\r\nWater Supply & Firefighting\r\n7. To Maintain the fire hydrant system, including couplings of 70mm or 75mm.\r\n8. To Install a fire pump with 8 bar pressure.\r\n\r\nEmergency Preparedness\r\n9. To Provide an evacuation plan.\r\n10. To Provide emergency phone numbers: Police, Fire Brigade, and Ambulance.\r\n\r\nSecurity\r\n11. To Provide security screening equipment: Metal hand-held detector and under-vehicle mirror.', NULL, NULL, 27.00, 66.00, 40.91, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 11:07:04', '2026-09-10 11:07:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(250, NULL, 239, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'mineral-trading activities are incompatible with the approved Master Plan land use and are associated with dust and noise impacts on the surrounding neighborhood.', 'Relocate the mining-trading activities to an approved area designated for such activities', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 11:51:33', '2026-09-11 10:01:21', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(251, NULL, 240, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 2, '_ _ no effluent test results \r\n_ drainage channel of used water for cleaning are mixed with rain water\r\n_', 'to separate rain water and wastewater used for cleaning \r\n_ to avail effluent test results which comply with national standard before discharge \r\n_ empty final trial tank', NULL, NULL, 7.00, 12.00, 58.33, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 12:22:34', '2026-09-10 12:22:38', 'Ref.No.160/07.01.17/24', 2024, 'Ayele Demissie yilma', '0787419067', 'stp', NULL, 'other', 'Wastewater treatment plant', 26.00, NULL, NULL, 2026, '2026-08-30', '2026-08-30', NULL, 'functional', '_ no effluent test results \r\n_ drainage channel of used water for cleaning are mixed with rain water\r\n_', NULL, NULL, 'other', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(252, NULL, 241, 16, 'waste_water', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 23, 'MUNYANEZA Honeste', 3, '1. Outlet pipe was observed from the septic tank to the public drainage channel.\r\n2. No ventilation pipe.', '1. Immediately stop the discharge of septic tank effluent in the public drainage channel, and arrange regular vacuum truck emptying and keep records.\r\n2. Immediately close and cease completely the outlet pipe from the septic tank to the public drainage channel.\r\n3. Set the ventilation pipe for the septic tank.', NULL, NULL, 7.00, 11.00, 63.64, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 12:37:27', '2026-09-10 12:47:40', 'Not available on the site', NULL, 'SIBOMANA Philemon', '0788512473', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'single_chamber', 1, 'concrete', 20.00, NULL, 5.00, 'inside_compound', 'not_applicable', 'direct_discharge', 'DACHRIS Ltd', 'unable_to_determine', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(253, NULL, 242, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To install a water-based firefighting system, including an adequate water storage tank, hose reels, fire hydrants, and a fire pump capable of delivering a pressure of 8-15 bars.\r\nb. To provide sufficient fire extinguishers throughout the building, ensuring that at least one appropriate fire extinguisher is installed within every 15-meter travel distance and maintained in serviceable condition.\r\nc. To install  CCTV cameras with a dedicated control room and ensure that recorded footage is retained for a minimum period of 90 days (three months).\r\nd. To display emergency safety information at strategic locations within the building, including: Emergency exit signs; Emergency evacuation plans; Emergency contact numbers for the Police, Fire Brigade, and Ambulance services; and Designated emergency assembly point signs.\r\ne. To submit all documents to the City of Kigali, including the occupation permit, building insurance, and electrical installation compliance certificate, through info@kigalicity.gov.rw.\r\nf. To remove all unauthorized obstructions and alterations made to the first-floor walkway and restore the area in accordance with the approved architectural drawings to ensure safe access, circulation, and compliance with building regulations.\r\ng. To obtain the necessary approvals and permits from the relevant authorities before undertaking any future modifications or additions to the building structure.', NULL, NULL, 15.00, 59.00, 25.42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 12:44:29', '2026-09-10 12:44:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(254, NULL, 243, 16, 'waste_water', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, 'The septic tank was full of wastewater and appeared to be undersized for waste from the toilet and kitchen; this resulted in unpleasant odours.', '1. Immediately empty/desluge the septic tank using a licensed septic service provider.\r\n2. Increase the septic tank capacity or construct a sewage treatment plant\r\n3. Prevent any discharge of untreated wastewater from your septic tank into public drainage', NULL, NULL, 8.00, 14.00, 57.14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-10 13:01:25', '2026-09-10 13:01:26', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'prefabricated', 4, 'plastic', 20.00, 2016, 18.00, 'inside_compound', 'fair', 'emptying', 'KANGUKA BUSINESS', 'undersized', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
