(347, NULL, 336, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-17', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, '.The air blowers of the Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) were found not functioning at the time of inspection, resulting in inadequate aeration of the biological treatment process and unpleasant odour', '.To repair or replace the non-functional air blowers, diffuser and associated components immediately and ensure that adequate aeration is continuously maintained. \r\n.To conduct effluent quality test of treated waste water \r\n. To record all maintenance activities in logbook', NULL, NULL, 9.00, 16.00, 56.25, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-20 17:02:51', '2026-09-20 17:02:51', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'package', NULL, 17.00, 200, 16.00, 2020, '2026-08-26', '2026-08-28', 'as_needed', 'partially_functional', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(348, NULL, 337, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-18', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, '.The STP  found to be poorly maintained, with several treatment processes and equipment not functioning properly. The required treatment stages were not operating effectively, resulting in inadequate treatment of the incoming sewage. The final effluent was observed to be black in colour, indicating poor treatment and a high level of  a suspended solid waste and directly discharged into environment', '. Immediately stop discharging untreated waste water into environment \r\n.To restored STP immediately to full operation. All defective equipment, including pumps, blowers, aeration systems, controls, and other treatment units, should be repaired or replaced. \r\n.To conduct effluent quality test for the treated waste water \r\n.To keep all records related to maintenance in logbook', NULL, NULL, 8.00, 16.00, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-20 18:21:48', '2026-09-20 18:24:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'sbr', NULL, 91.20, 700, NULL, 2018, '2026-09-14', '2024-12-01', 'as_needed', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-29', 'WASAC', 'soak_pit', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(349, NULL, 338, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'Entity does not comply with fire safety and security regulations', '1. To install a fully functional water-based fire-fighting system including hose reels, fire hydrants with short couplings (45mm - 70mm), a 30m³ dedicated fire water tank, and a fire pump with a pressure capacity of 8-15 bar.\r\n2. To install a fire alarm system with a control panel in every building.\r\n3. To increase the number of fire extinguishers to cover every 15m of the compound and to mount all existing extinguishers at the appropriate height of 1.5m.\r\n4. To install a wet chemical fire extinguisher in the kitchen.\r\n5. To upgrade CCTV camera storage capacity to retain footage for at least 3 months.\r\n6. To test the para-lightning protection system every six (6) months by a certified engineer and obtain valid test results. Earth resistance should be ≤ 5Ω.\r\n7. To revise the electrical installation every 3 years and obtain a compliance certificate.\r\n\r\n8. To restock the First Aid Box with all required elements and replace all expired items.\r\n9. To provide general accessibility for persons with disabilities.\r\n10. To properly contain laundry waste water and stop overflow into the storm water drainage.\r\n11. To deep clean the entire Sauna and its laundry area.\r\n12. To remove and dispose of all old materials in the Sauna, including old utensils.\r\n13. To put in place proper storage for Sauna utensils.\r\n14. To avail the following documents: Occupation Permit and Valid Building Insurance.\r\n15. To carry out maintenance and renovation works on the old buildings to improve their condition and ensure safe use.\r\n\r\nDocuments can be submitted via e-mail: info@kigalicity.gov.rw\r\n\r\nNote: All recommendations must be implemented within 15 days from today', NULL, NULL, 39.00, 70.00, 55.71, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 07:29:32', '2026-09-21 11:46:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(350, NULL, 291, 16, 'waste_water', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 2, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 14.00, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 08:02:22', '2026-09-21 08:02:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(351, NULL, 339, 16, 'waste_water', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 24, 'UWERA Marie Josee', 3, '- At Rubis Petrol Station Nyabugogo 1, the septic tank is full and has not been emptied recently.\r\n- Oil spills have been observed in the parking area at the rear of Rubis Petrol Station Nyabugogo 1, resulting from garage activities conducted in the parking area.', '- The septic tank should be emptied/desludged immediately.\r\n- They should provide proper proof of emptying activities with licenced company.\r\n- Garage activities conducted in the Parking area should be stopped.', NULL, NULL, 3.00, 11.00, 27.27, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 08:38:25', '2026-09-21 11:18:28', NULL, NULL, 'BIBWIREYESU Sion', '0781861283', 'septic_tank', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'three_chamber', NULL, 'concrete', 50.00, 2022, NULL, 'inside_compound', 'poor', 'emptying', NULL, 'undersized', '- At Rubis Petrol Station Nyabugogo 1, the septic tank is full and has not been emptied recently.\r\n- Oil spills have been observed in the parking area at the rear of Rubis Petrol Station Nyabugogo 1, resulting from garage activities conducted in the parking area.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(352, NULL, 340, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The inspection identified several deficiencies in fire safety, security, sanitation, maintenance, and safety systems that require corrective action to ensure proper compliance and safe operation.', '1.	Upgrade the CCTV storage capacity to retain recorded footage for at least three months. \r\n2.	Provide functional fire hydrants, sand boxes, and clearly marked assembly-point signs in all parking areas. Fire hydrants should be clearly visible and accessible. \r\n3.	Establish an elevator maintenance schedule every six months and maintain proper maintenance records. \r\n4.	Provide emergency exit signs on all floors, including floors where signs are currently missing. \r\n5.	Improve general kitchen cleanliness, particularly inside refrigerators and other food-storage areas. \r\n6.	Provide an appropriate sewage treatment system, including necessary treatment processes such as chlorination and filtration. \r\n7.	Carry out appropriate pest-control measures around the premises and maintain the required hygiene conditions. \r\n8.	Provide and maintain a functional sewage treatment plant (STP) for proper wastewater management. \r\n9.	Conduct the required maintenance and servicing of firefighting systems and equipment and keep proper records. \r\n10.	Ensure that required fire safety systems are tested periodically and that documented test records are maintained. \r\n11.	Test the lightning protection system every six months and maintain documented testing records. \r\n12.	Provide an appropriate wet-chemical fire extinguisher/system for the kitchen where required.', NULL, NULL, 78.00, 90.00, 86.67, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 10:16:54', '2026-09-21 10:16:54', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(353, NULL, 341, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 19, 'NSENGIMANA Private', 1, 'The inspection identified some areas requiring improvement, particularly security screening equipment maintenance, emergency information in the elevator, regular inspection records, waste segregation, staff health checks, and wastewater management.', '1.	Conduct regular maintenance of the security screening equipment, including the luggage scanner and walk-through metal detector. \r\n2.	Provide emergency contact information inside the elevator for use in case of an emergency. \r\n3.	Conduct regular inspections of the installed safety systems and maintain proper inspection records. \r\n4.	Provide clearly labelled and appropriately coloured waste bins for biodegradable and non-biodegradable waste. Ensure proper waste segregation and that relevant staff receive the required medical check-ups. \r\n5.	Continue the regular emptying of wastewater from toilets, kitchens, laundry areas, and other relevant facilities, and maintain proper records.\r\n6.TO Clearly display emergency contact numbers for police, fire brigade, and ambulance.', NULL, NULL, 88.00, 92.00, 95.65, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 11:37:44', '2026-09-21 11:37:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(354, NULL, 342, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 7, 'SENZIRA Eugene', 2, 'Entity does not comply with fire safety and security regulations', '1. To test the para-lightning protection system every six (6) months by a competent engineer and obtain valid test results. Earth resistance must be ≤ 5Ω.\r\n2. To conduct an electrical installation audit every 3 years and obtain a compliance certificate.\r\n\r\n3. To install a fully functional water-based fire-fighting system including hose reel (30m), fire hydrants with Storz coupling (45mm - 70mm), a 30m³ dedicated water tank for fire-fighting, and a fire pump with a minimum pressure of 8 bar.\r\n4. To install a fully functional fire alarm system with control panel, smoke detectors, and manual call points.\r\n5. To install a 9kg CO2 fire extinguisher at the generator house or provide an automatic fire suppression system.\r\n6. To provide a First Aid Box with all required elements in the kitchen.\r\n7. To upgrade CCTV camera storage capacity to retain footage for at least 3 months (90 days).\r\n8. To install gas detectors with shut-off valves and fix all gas leakage problems.\r\n9. To provide audible sound / alarm in the elevator.\r\n\r\n10. To establish temperature monitoring and recording for the cold room.\r\n11. To ensure all food items are properly labelled in the cold room.\r\n12. To improve general hygiene and cleanliness of the back compound.\r\n13. To repair all waste water leakages along the fence / retaining wall.\r\n14. To immediately rehabilitate and restore the Sewage Treatment Plant (STP) to full functionality and ensure proper operation and maintenance.\r\n\r\n15. To undertake general rehabilitation and maintenance of the building structures, including all damaged, deteriorated, or unsafe components.\r\nNote:all recommendations should be implemented with 15 days from today', NULL, NULL, 63.00, 86.00, 73.26, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 12:04:41', '2026-09-21 12:04:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(355, NULL, 343, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To replace all fire extinguishers that are out of service.\r\nb. To install an automated fire suppression system (FM-200) in the powerhouse to enhance fire protection measures.\r\nc. To repair and maintain the elevator’s audible announcement system to ensure that it clearly announces floor levels and elevator arrival.\r\nd. To display clear signage prohibiting the use of elevators during emergencies or fire incidents.\r\ne. To send electrical installation compliance certificate, lightning protection system test report, elevator maintenance report, valid medical certificates for kitchen staff members, occupation permit, and building insurance to the City of Kigali via email: info@kigalicity.gov.rw.\r\nf. To immediately sort and remove all rotten or damaged fruits and to store fresh fruits separately in clean, well-ventilated containers while maintaining the FIFO (First In, First Out) system.\r\ng. To immediately  replace the expired disinfectant with an approved, valid, and properly labelled salad disinfectant and to regularly monitor expiry dates before use.\r\nh. To provide adequately stocked first aid boxes at the reception area and in all kitchen areas, and to conduct regular inspections to ensure that all essential supplies are available and that used or expired items are replaced.\r\ni. To provide covered dustbins in the garbage room to improve waste management and hygiene conditions.\r\nk. To implement all recommendations within thirty (30) days from the date of inspection.', NULL, NULL, 70.00, 93.00, 75.27, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 16:27:51', '2026-09-21 18:02:37', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(356, NULL, 344, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, '.STP is partially functioning due to lack of same stage of it\r\n. They are currently emptying it \r\n.No maintenance logbook available \r\n.No contract with maintenance company \r\n.', '.To continue regular emptying and keep records and avoid any discharge of untreated waste water', NULL, NULL, 9.00, 17.00, 52.94, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 16:29:00', '2026-09-21 17:49:48', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'activated_sludge', NULL, 60.00, 100, NULL, 2022, '2026-09-01', '2026-09-01', 'as_needed', 'partially_functional', 'STP lack Disinfection system and currently they are emptying the final partially treated waste water', NULL, NULL, 'other', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(357, NULL, 345, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To display emergency evacuation plans in clearly visible and easily accessible locations on every floor so that occupants can quickly identify emergency exits, escape routes, and firefighting equipment.\r\nb. To display emergency contact numbers inside the elevators and provide clear signs prohibiting the use of elevators in case of fire.\r\nc. To use standard signs indicating the assembly points.\r\nd. To provide sufficient fire-sand boxes filled with dry fine sand in the parking area and equipped with appropriate shovels.\r\ne. To perform periodic maintenance of electrical installations and obtain an Electrical Installation Compliance Certificate every three years.\r\nf. To send  electrical installation compliance certificate, lightning protection system test report, and elevator maintenance report to the City of Kigali through email: info@kigalicity.gov.rw.\r\ng. To replace analog cameras within the facility.\r\nh. To enhance and maintain proper hygiene and cleanliness in all toilet facilities, particularly those located on the 4th floor.\r\ni. To immediately remove and safely dispose of all expired fish fingers/brochettes and ensure regular checks of food expiry dates.\r\nj. To properly label all food items stored in refrigerators with preparation and expiry dates to ensure proper traceability and stock control.\r\nk. To relocate the small dry store from the hot kitchen to a suitable, clean, and well-organized storage area.\r\nl. To properly organize and store kitchen equipment in designated storage areas.\r\nm. To install a suitable wet-chemical fire extinguisher in the kitchen.\r\nn. To clearly label all kitchen sections and work areas to facilitate proper identification and organization.\r\no. To strictly separate cooked food from raw meat in the freezer by storing them in separate and properly labelled areas/containers.\r\np. To replace old and worn-out cutting boards to maintain hygienic food preparation conditions.\r\nl. To implement all the above recommendations within 30 days.', NULL, NULL, 67.00, 86.00, 77.91, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 18:27:50', '2026-09-22 05:17:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(358, NULL, 346, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-18', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, '.No valid effluent quality test of treated waste water \r\n.Presence of  suspended solids and other impurities from the treated waste water \r\n.No maintenance company \r\n.No maintenance logbook', '. To Repair or replace immediately ,the malfunctioning filtration system .\r\n.To conduct effluent quality test of treated waste water every six months \r\n.To find a licenced company by RURA for maintenance \r\n.To keep all records regarding maintenance', NULL, NULL, 11.00, 17.00, 64.71, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 18:28:57', '2026-09-21 18:30:28', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'activated_sludge', NULL, 7.50, 100, 6.00, 2014, '2026-09-18', '2026-08-21', 'quarterly', 'partially_functional', NULL, '2024-04-23', 'University of Rwanda -CST', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(359, NULL, 347, 3, 'building', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 9, 'UWIKUNDA Idesbald', 3, NULL, 'a. To install a fully functional fire alarm system with a control panel throughout the facility.\r\nb. To maintain adequate water pressure for firefighting equipment by increasing the pressure in the hose reel system and ensuring that the pump provides a pressure of 8–15 bar.\r\nc. To display emergency exit and evacuation plans and clearly display emergency contact numbers for the police, ambulance, and fire brigade.\r\nd. To install additional CCTV cameras at the laundry area and entrance to improve security coverage.\r\ne. To install a metal detector at the entrance and establish an appropriate security screening mechanism for visitors.\r\nf. To make the assembly point accessible by removing obstructions from the parking area.\r\ng. To provide a suitable wet chemical fire extinguisher for the cooking area.\r\nh. To clearly label all kitchen sections and ensure that all areas are properly identified.\r\ni. To replace old and unhygienic kitchen utensils and equipment, including saucepans and other worn-out items.\r\nj. To immediately remove and replace broken plates in the kitchen.\r\nk. To improve cleanliness and housekeeping practices in the food preparation area, storage area, and kitchen.\r\nl. To relocate waste bins to a designated waste collection area and ensure proper waste management.\r\nm. To replace the old mosquito nets in the rooms.\r\nn. To replace old and worn-out tables and chairs with suitable furniture.\r\no. To increase cleaning frequency to prevent dust accumulation in the rooms and equipment.\r\np. To keep laundry items in a designated and properly organized storage area.\r\nq. To improve cleaning and housekeeping practices in the laundry area and ensure that appropriate hygiene and sanitation standards are maintained.\r\nR. To update the medical certificates of kitchen staff within two weeks.\r\nS. To submit the electrical installation compliance certificate and lightning protection system test report to the City of Kigali through the official email address: info@kigalicity.gov.rw.\r\nT. To implement all the above recommendations within 30 days.', NULL, NULL, 33.00, 64.00, 51.56, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21 18:42:22', '2026-09-22 05:28:57', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(360, NULL, 348, 15, 'waste_water', 'stp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-21', 'new', NULL, 1, 'completed', 22, 'MUGABO Serge', 1, '.The STP is partially functional, with some treatment processes not operating effectively.\r\n.The aeration s and filtration Systems are not functioning properly\r\n.Bad odour and suspended solids was observed in final effluent \r\n.No valid effluent quality test results', '.T conduct a comprehensive maintenance of the entire STP and restore all treatment units to proper working condition.\r\n.To conduct effluent quality test of treated waste water \r\n. To keep records of maintenance in logbook', NULL, NULL, 11.00, 17.00, 64.71, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-22 02:48:17', '2026-09-22 02:48:17', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'stp', NULL, 'activated_sludge', NULL, 15.00, 100, 10.00, 2009, '2026-08-12', NULL, 'as_needed', 'partially_functional', NULL, '2025-09-03', 'University of Rwanda -CST', 'public_drainage', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
